#: src/main.ui:73
msgid ""
"Snapshots of your face that Ubuntu Hello compares against. Keep at least "
"two, recorded in different lighting."
msgstr ""
"Ko nga whakaahua o to kanohi ka whakatauritea e Ubuntu Hello. Kia mau ki te "
"rua, ka tuhia ki nga rama rereke."

#: src/main.ui:95
msgid "Showing saved models for:"
msgstr "Whakaatu ana i nga tauira kua tiakina mo:"

#: src/main.ui:135
msgid ""
"Only one face model is enrolled. Lighting changes how your face looks to the "
"camera, so a single model can fail in the evening under lamps (or in "
"daylight). Add a second model recorded in different light to keep unlocking "
"reliable at any time of day."
msgstr ""
"Kotahi anake te tauira kanohi kua whakauruhia. Ka huri te rama i te ahua o "
"to kanohi ki te kaamera, no reira ka ngaro te tauira kotahi i te ahiahi i "
"raro i nga rama (i te awatea ranei). Taapirihia he tauira tuarua kua tuhia i "
"roto i nga rama rereke kia mau tonu te wetewete pono i nga wa katoa o te ra."

#: src/main.ui:144
